  "title": "Built for Generations: Toyota Corolla Celebrates 60 Years with 2027 Special Edition",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas (Aug. 18, 2026) – Sixty years, countless journeys and one unmistakable name. The Toyota Corolla is celebrating six decades of reliability, efficiency and a legacy that spans the globe with the new 2027 Corolla 60th Anniversary Special Edition, bringing a fresh look to a name that has kept generations of drivers moving.",
